# v58: The skills/ directory is MANDATORY — do NOT exclude.
# 69 ClawHub skills (61MB) are loaded at runtime by src/lib/skill-loader.ts.
# Without them, the agent fleet cannot access specialized tools.
# (Previously excluded — restored in v57+ as a non-negotiable rule.)
